"Identifier could not be discarded. Please try again. If the problem "
"persists, contact user support."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo descartar el identificador. Inténtelo nuevamente. Si el problema "
"persiste, contacte con el servicio de asistencia al usuario."

msgid ""
"Draft save failed before file upload. Please try again. If the problem "
"persists, contact user support."
